  "arithmetic": "net@2/case ~= share * 50 * 0.166 * 3dp. The 0.166 is the digest's share of the window (8.3 of 50). Against NR-47's +-0.78 bootstrap at n = 37: below 5% nothing is measurable at any dp; 16% is the threshold at a GENEROUS dp = 0.2; at the dp NR-48 actually observed (0.951 displaced by 0.859, dp = 0.092) the requirement is 34% of the window. Clearing 5% is necessary, not sufficient.",
